<Layout title="Engineering Work | Conor Brown" description="Selected distributed systems, software architecture and modernization work by Conor Brown.">
<main><div class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">Selected experience</p><h1>Engineering work.</h1><p class="lead">Production systems, architecture improvements, and technical leadership. Previous employer details are intentionally described at a high level to respect confidentiality.</p></div>
<div class="grid">{work.map(item=><article class="card"><span class="tag">{item.tag}</span><h2>{item.title}</h2><p>{item.summary}</p><ul>{item.points.map(point=><li>{point}</li>)}</ul>{item.article&&<div class="actions"><a class="button" href={item.article}>Read the architecture case study →</a></div>}</article>)}</div>
<section class="note"><strong>Want to go deeper?</strong><p>I'm happy to discuss architecture decisions, tradeoffs, and lessons learned in an interview while respecting previous employers' proprietary information.</p></section></main>
</Layout>